            ("Is mounting with butter the same as beurre manié?", "No. Beurre manié is soft butter and flour in equal parts by weight, kept raw and added to tighten. Monter au beurre has no flour. The butter is there for gloss and a rounder flavour, not for starch. If the sauce is thin in body and you need it to cling, the raw paste is the other gesture."),
